Third-party attribution
------------------------
The `buzzwatch_data_analysis/` package (the activity-tracking engine: background
extraction, the flying/resting trackers, and the per-experiment analysis pipeline)
is derived from the original BuzzWatch project, credited in-source as the
"BuzzWatch Analysis Team". The package name and its internal class names are kept
unchanged from the original so that existing `.pkl` tracking files (which store
these names as part of their serialized format) continue to load correctly.

If you are the original BuzzWatch author/maintainer and would like different
attribution, or can confirm the license terms of the original work, please open
an issue.
